license: MIT (./foliate-js/LICENSE); vendored zip.js BSD-3-Clause, fflate MIT,
  PDF.js 5.5.207 Apache-2.0 (its standard fonts and character maps carry their
  own licences beside them)
# Left out of the copy: PDF.js's source maps (vendor/pdfjs/*.map), the demo
# reader (reader.html, reader.js, ui/), tests/, and build and lint tooling.
# vite.config.ts copies vendor/pdfjs into the built reader beside the PDF
# adapter's chunk, which fetches it only when a PDF opens.
# Upgrade on purpose: replace ./foliate-js from the new commit with the same
# exclusions, then update this file.
